    "slug": "five-letter-words-starting-with-q",
    "excerpt": "Q is one of the rarest starting letters in Wordle. Browse all five-letter Q words, valid guesses, and tips for when Q appears in your puzzle.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z",
