    "slug": "five-letter-words-starting-with-o",
    "excerpt": "45 five-letter words start with O. Browse common Wordle answers, valid guesses, and subgroups like OB-, OC-, OR- words with solving examples.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z",
